格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH 个人配置:Token 用量统计 / 成本估算 / 自定义指令 / 外观全局字号 / 桌面宠物(含会话状态概览),纯本地不联网。Personal center for DSH: usage stats, cost estimation, custom instructions, global font size & desktop pet with session overview — all local & offline.","id":"gh:1339844498","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-personal-center","slug":"PolinniZhong/dsh-personal-center","topics":["appearance","cost-estimation","custom-instructions","deepseek-harness","desktop-companion","desktop-pet","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","font-size","personal-center","pet","plugin","session-status","token-usage","usage-statistics"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH 个人配置:Token 用量统计 / 成本估算 / 自定义指令 / 外观全局字号 / 桌面宠物(含会话状态概览),纯本地不联网。Personal center for DSH: usage st"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ats, cost estimation, custom instructions, global font size & desktop pet with session overview — al"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"on, custom instructions, global font size & desktop pet with session overview — all local & offline."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-personal-center"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A local, offline personal center for DeepSeek Harness — usage stats, cost estimation, custom instr"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"uctions, global font size, and a desktop pet."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A local plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) desktop / web. Adds a **Personal Center** section to Setti"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ngs, with three tabs:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Token Usage** — real usage stats: today / cumulative tokens, session count, tool calls, a GitHub"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"-style activity heatmap (daily / weekly / cumulative), per-provider breakdown (with per-model detail"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"), top tools, and session review; with sub-tabs (Overview / Review / Model Cost).\n- **Personalizatio"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"n** — global custom instructions (like ChatGPT / Codex \"Personalization → Custom instructions\"), app"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"lied to all chats on this machine.\n- **Desktop Pet** — bitmap (black / blue whale) and vector (\"roun"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"d black / round blue\") skins, driven by your real usage (5 emotions), with a session-status overview"},{"id":"p5s7","text":" (double-click a session to jump into it)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Model cost estimation** lives inside Token Usage: per-model pricing (peak / off-peak, per currency"},{"id":"p6s2","text":", official presets) plus cache-hit-rate stats."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"100% local — no network, no reading chat content. See PRIVACY.md. Bilingual UI (中文 / English), follo"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ws DSH's language automatically."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 📸 Screenshots"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Four tabs (v1.0)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Token Usage | Personalization |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Pet |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Feature details"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Token Usage · light | Review · dark |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Pet panel · light | Pet panel · dark |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Session status overview (double-click to jump) |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Five emotion animations** (happy / busy / tired / wallet-pain / dozing):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Black whale | Blue whale |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**New actions (v0.8.0)** (thinking / waiting / celebrate / drag / wave):"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Black whale | Blue whale |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Model cost · dark |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Personalization · per workspace (layered instructions + templates) |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Token Usage (statistics)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Today overview**: token consumption / sessions / tool calls;\n- **Cumulative data**: total tokens"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" / longest chat / total sessions / **cache-hit rate** / **estimated cost**;\n- **Token activity**: Gi"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"tHub-contribution-style heatmap with **daily / weekly / cumulative** views;\n- **Per-provider breakdo"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"wn**: grouped by provider with subtotals plus per-model detail (tokens, requests, **cache-hit rate**"},{"id":"p24s5","text":", cost) — multiple providers and models tracked separately;\n- **Top tools**: sorted by call count (i"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"ncluding MCP tools in `mcp__<server>__<tool>` form);\n- **Session review**: recent sessions (title / "},{"id":"p24s7","text":"date / duration / tokens / cache-hit rate), **auto-excludes archived sessions**."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Data source: aggregates local session logs (session.v4 / session.v3 / legacy) in real time — numbers"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" only, never reads content. See docs/common/DESIGN.md."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Model Cost (estimation)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Per-model cost per million tokens, split by **currency** (¥/$);\n- **Peak / off-peak** pricing (Dee"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"pSeek official: Beijing 9:00–12:00 & 14:00–18:00 peak, off-peak = half);\n- Built-in presets (deepsee"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"k / kimi / gemini / gpt) with provider→model autocomplete, editable;\n- Shows **this week / this mont"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"h / cumulative** cost."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Personalization (layered instructions: v0.7)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **Global instructions** (identity baseline): identity / working principles / response preferences,"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" applied to every chat on this machine;\n- **Per-workspace instructions** (project-specific): each wo"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"rkspace gets its own instructions, injected by **longest-prefix cwd match** as \"global + workspace\" "},{"id":"p29s4","text":"merged text; unconfigured workspaces fall back to global only;\n- **Template library**: 5 built-in te"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"mplates (PM / developer / writing / translator / general assistant), one-click apply to global or cu"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"rrent workspace; save / edit / delete your own;\n- **Injection preview**: live \"global + current work"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"space\" merged text + ≈token estimate at the bottom;\n- All local (settings.yaml), zero network, no mi"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"gration of existing `custom-instructions` data; bilingual, DSH design tokens."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- The engine scans all stylesheets for DSH `--dsw-font-*` tokens and hard-coded font-size rules, the"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"n offsets everything by \"current − 14\" via a `<style>` override layer — **at the default 14 the laye"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"r is empty and the UI is 100% untouched**;\n- Only shifts global font size, never touches other modul"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"es' layout; local, zero network."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Desktop Pet (black / blue whale)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- A round little black whale in the bottom-right corner (S size by default), pure frontend, zero dep"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"s (alpha-transparent WebP assets, dark-theme outline glow);\n- **Vector skins** (v1.1): \"round black "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"/ round blue\" (`black-vector` / `blue-vector`) — pure-DOM (radial-gradient body + capsule eyes), **z"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ero assets**; mouse-follow in four layers (eyes / head shift / deform / light source) + turn perspec"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"tive (side eye shrinks, eye gap compresses) + blink on approach / squint on eye click / tickle on bo"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"dy click / random head zoom; coexists with bitmap skins (mutually exclusive), switching rebuilds the"},{"id":"p32s7","text":" instance;\n- **Pet list**: black whale / blue whale each with a full config card (preview + today's "},{"id":"p32s8","text":"stats + opacity + toggle), **mutually exclusive — only one enabled at a time**; the preview art play"},{"id":"p32s9","text":"s random idle expressions while the panel is open (rotates every 10s, wakes on enable); disabled car"},{"id":"p32s10","text":"ds stay static;\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 🤔 Why (project rationale summary)"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"1. **Feasible**: DSH is plugin-based (host plugin + browser bundle); session logs record token usage"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" and tool-call events; MCP tools are named `mcp__<server>__<tool>` for direct categorization;\n2. **U"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ser psychology**: quantified feedback (GitHub-contribution style), cost transparency (per-token bill"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"ing), differentiation (no official personal center / global stats), privacy-friendly (aggregates onl"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"y);\n3. **Risks & mitigations**: install barrier → one-click install; data accuracy → read authoritat"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"ive logs; performance → host-side aggregation + 60s cache."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

